  <p id="c-nanqishu-040-zijun:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">衡陽王<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zijun:p001:m0003" ref="kix_r92_2ed_J">子峻</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zijun:p001:m0006" ref="kix_r92_2ed_J">雲嵩</persName>，世祖第十八子也。永明七年，封廣漢郡王。建武中，改封。永泰元年，見殺。年十四。</p>
